cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Bayesian inference on the 2D Ising model"
abstract: "Markov-chain Monte Carlo simulation of the 2D Ising model (Metropolis and Wolff cluster updates) with Bayesian inference of its critical temperature and exponents ν and β. A finite-size-scaling fit of the Binder cumulant and the magnetisation over several lattice sizes, with flat priors, a fit range chosen by a χ² goodness-of-fit test, and statistical and systematic errors, is compared with Onsager's exact solution. A pure power-law fit to a single lattice and multi-histogram reweighting are included as checks."
authors:
